# {{.ProjectName}}

A blockchain security watcher built with [Asentric SDK](https://github.com/asentric/asentric).

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
go mod tidy

# Run watcher (default: listens to all ERC20 events with value > 100)
go run cmd/watcher/main.go
```

### What's Included

By default, this watcher includes:

- **ERC20 Default Rule**: Automatically detects all ERC20 Transfer/Mint/Burn events with value > 100 tokens
- **Console Logging**: Events are printed to console for demo purposes
- **Webhook Support**: Configure webhook URL in `config/asentric.yaml` to receive alerts

The default rule will:
- Listen to **all ERC20 contracts** on the configured chain
- Detect **Transfer**, **Mint** (from zero address), and **Burn** (to zero address) events
- Filter events with value **> 100 tokens** (assuming 18 decimals by default)
- Print detected events to console with full details

